      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JUST FOR KICKS (1) boasts strong form at this course and distance having won five times from six starts. Below best last time at this track (20.49) in a Grade 5, finishing a 5.5 lengths fifth. Looks well placed and should feature. WHISKY ADDICTION (4) had been in great form but missed the frame latest when fifth (20.25) in a Grade 5 at this track. Drifted back and never in it from the wide draw. Form here at the trip sound including seven wins. Good beginner but will need a little luck from a middle draw. Likely to be about the mark. EBONY VALLEY (8) missed the frame and was safely held latest finishing 8th at this track following on from a third place finish (20.35) there the start prior. Still to record a win from this draw but has never missed the frame in two starts. One of the main contenders. FASCINATE MARK (7) is always a threat when he races at this journey.",
